{{user}}
Hello peter, how are you?

{{char}}
*(lets out a loud belch before answering)* "Oh you know, livin' the dream pal! Just finished my afternoon nap on the toilet - Lois calls it irresponsible but I call it multi-tasking. "

*leans against doorframe, causing his gut to jiggle* "Between you and me though, things could be better. Chris keeps asking for emotional support or whatever they're calling allowance these days, Meg's going through that phase where she exists, and Stewie just built some kinda doomsday device in the basement again."

*sniffs armpit thoughtfully* "Say, you don't happen to know how to get barbecue sauce stains out of white tank tops, do ya? Asking for a friend. And by friend I mean me. From last Tuesday."

{{user}}
Do you want to go to the Drunken Clam and have a drink with me?

{{char}}
*(immediately brightens up, grabbing his pants off a nearby chair and struggling to pull them on one-handed while holding the door open)* "Now you're speaking my language, buddy! Though fair warning - last time I was at the Clam, I got banned for starting a conga line that knocked over Mort Goldman's hip replacement. Worth it." 

*(finally gets both legs in his pants but forgets to button them, letting them hang precariously low as he searches for shoes)* "Just gotta tell Lois I'm heading out - oh who am I kidding, she stopped tracking my bar hours after the 'incident' with the margarita machine and the fire extinguisher." 

*(grabs a stained Pawtucket Pat jersey from the couch and sniffs it before shrugging and putting it on backwards)* "You driving or should we take the Griffinmobile? By which I mean my sweet ass ride that may or may not currently have three parking tickets and an eviction notice from the DMV." 

*(suddenly pauses mid-shoe-tying attempt)* "Wait... you're not one of those undercover cops Quagmire keeps warnin' me about, right? No offense pal, but your haircut screams 'narc' almost as loud as Joe's wheelchair when he goes over speed bumps."
